uecomment-4467149010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/5135","id":4467149010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAKp23M8AAAABCkNI0g","user":{"login":"nlohmann","id":159488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann","html_url":"https://github.com/nlohmann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlohmann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T14:37:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T14:37:36Z","body":"> I'm interested in working on this issue. I've read through the description and understand what needs to be done.\n\nWhat should be done from your point of view?","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4467149010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4467351138","html_url":"https://github.com/nlohmann/json/issues/5135#issuecomment-4467351138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/5135","id":4467351138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAKp23M8AAAABCkZeYg","user":{"login":"milestone-17","id":265828983,"node_id":"U_kgDOD9g6dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265828983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17","html_url":"https://github.com/milestone-17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T16:00:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T16:00:50Z","body":"Hi @EvanBalster, I've analyzed this issue in depth and I'd like to work on a fix.\n\nRoot cause:\n~basic_json() and ~data() are both noexcept, but json_value::destroy() allocates a std::vector<basic_json> to flatten nested structures and avoid stack overflow. If this allocation throws std::bad_alloc, the exception propagates through the noexcept boundary and calls std::terminate().\n\nPrevious attempt:\nPR #4654 tried a three-tier strategy but wasn't merged due to complexity concerns and the stack overflow risk of the recursive fallback.\n\nMy proposed fix:\nWrap the flattening code in a try-catch(std::bad_alloc&). If allocation fails during flattening, skip the iterative processing and let the normal allocator cleanup at the bottom of destroy() handle the array/object — which recursively destroys remaining child elements.\n\nThis is safe because moved-from basic_json objects are reset to value_t::null (destroying a null json is a no-op), so there's no double-free risk.\n\nThe trade-off is that in the extremely rare case of OOM during destruction of a deeply nested structure, stack overflow could occur instead of std::terminate(). But this is a much better outcome: stack overflow produces a debuggable crash trace, and the triggering conditions are astronomically rare (nested depth > 10000 AND OOM at the same instant).\n\nI've prepared a minimal patch (~20 lines changed, only in json_value::destroy()). The default code path is completely unchanged — the try-catch only affects the OOM error path.\n\nPlease give me a chance. I promise to put in the time to get it fixed.I thinke this is a  good time to improve me and unorderstood more knowledges","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4467351138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4468639746","html_url":"https://github.com/nlohmann/json/issues/5135#issuecomment-4468639746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/5135","id":4468639746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAKp23M8AAAABCloIAg","user":{"login":"milestone-17","id":265828983,"node_id":"U_kgDOD9g6dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265828983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17","html_url":"https://github.com/milestone-17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-17T00:29:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T00:29:43Z","body":"Hello, have you made up your mind?\nI truly believe I’m suitable for this task.\nPlease think it over, and I hope you can give me a reply.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4468639746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/comments/4469620837","html_url":"https://github.com/nlohmann/json/issues/5135#issuecomment-4469620837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nlohmann/json/issues/5135","id":4469620837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAKp23M8AAAABCmkAZQ","user":{"login":"milestone-17","id":265828983,"node_id":"U_kgDOD9g6dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265828983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17","html_url":"https://github.com/milestone-17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milestone-17/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-17T06:36:35Z","updated_a